 f2ap/postie.py      |   9 +++-
 f2ap/safefetch.py   | 121 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 f2ap/webserver.py   |  13 ++++-
 4 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 f2ap/safefetch.py

